@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5000

### List endpoints
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Comments (first page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments?limit=10&offset=0

### Comments (next page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments?limit=10&offset=10

### Look up one comment from the jsonl database (POST keeps &lc= intact)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jNQXAC9IVRw&lc=UgzxsAHHvWZkGR3gJVp4AaABAg"
}

### Look up one comment by lc
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comment?lc=UgzxsAHHvWZkGR3gJVp4AaABAg

### Look up one comment by encoded URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comment?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DjNQXAC9IVRw%26lc%3DUgzxsAHHvWZkGR3gJVp4AaABAg

### Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/summary

### By year
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/by-year

### By day
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/by-day

### Longest comments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/longest?limit=5

### Repeat commenters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/repeaters

### Languages (slow on first request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/languages
